{"id":"d4a3e97d0f2dc4db","group":"57","path":"57/57-ax-substitution-schema.md","title":"ax-substitution-schema","display":"ax-substitution-schema — ax-substitution-schema","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-ax-substitution-schema","aliases":["57-ax-substitution-schema"],"display":"ax-substitution-schema — ax-substitution-schema","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-ax-substitution-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-ax-substitution-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-substitution-schema — ax-substitution-schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"394f2aea09fc7e21\" href=\"?note=394f2aea09fc7e21\" title=\"57-df-formula-substitution\">57-df-formula-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"394f2aea09fc7e21\" href=\"?note=394f2aea09fc7e21\" title=\"57-df-formula-substitution\">57-df-formula-substitution</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathfrak F_S,S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathrm{FV},I,n_i\">\\(F,\\mathfrak F_S,S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathrm{FV},I,n_i\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in F\">\\(p\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>。为兼容原代数性质定理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[x/t]\">\\(p[x/t]\\)</span> 表示在变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 处代入项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>；这里明确保留该文件的参数排印次序，它不同于语法文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span>。元组代换逐分量定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p[x/t]\\coloneqq S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t),\\qquad\n(p_1,\\ldots,p_n)[x/t]\\coloneqq(p_1[x/t],\\ldots,p_n[x/t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p[x/t]\\coloneqq S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t),\\qquad\n(p_1,\\ldots,p_n)[x/t]\\coloneqq(p_1[x/t],\\ldots,p_n[x/t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\to\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\vec p\\in F^{n_i}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p)[x/t]=f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p[x/t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\to\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\vec p\\in F^{n_i}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p)[x/t]=f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p[x/t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原文件所引用但缺失的代数代换模式：结论是已定义自同态条件的展开，不另假定任意具体公式代入都具有这一性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"394f2aea09fc7e21","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"394f2aea09fc7e21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[57-df-formula-substitution]] 的 $F,\\mathfrak F_S,S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathrm{FV},I,n_i$。$p\\in F$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$。为兼容原代数性质定理，$p[x/t]$ 表示在变量 $x$ 处代入项 $t$；这里明确保留该文件的参数排印次序，它不同于语法文件的 $\\varphi[t/x]$。元组代换逐分量定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\mathfrak F_S,S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathrm{FV},I,n_i","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"p[x/t]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"p[x/t]\\coloneqq S_{\\mathfrak F}(p,x,t),\\qquad\n(p_1,\\ldots,p_n)[x/t]\\coloneqq(p_1[x/t],\\ldots,p_n[x/t]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)\\to\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall\\vec p\\in F^{n_i}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\nf_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p)[x/t]=f_i^{\\mathfrak F}(\\vec p[x/t]).","display":true}],"bytes":1187,"backlinks":[{"id":"7f378a9e1168485b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Subst}(S_{\\mathfrak F},\\mathfrak F_S)$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]、[[57-df-formula-substitution]]；载体、运算、元数及 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 采用这些文件的固定环境。$p[x/t]$ 与元组代换见 [[57-ax-substitution-schema]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omega]]\n[[57-df-ordered-pair]]\n[[57-df-partial-function]]\n[[57-df-pow-fin]]\n[[57-df-range]]\n[[57-df-relation-domain]]\n[[57-df-relation-symbol]]\n[[57-df-relation]]\n[[57-df-sequent-rule]]\n[[57-df-set-function]]\n[[57-df-set]]\n[[57-df-